          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;">Maintenance expenses are based on expense amounts directly assigned to the North Expansion Project. TransColorado's methodology for cost allocation and rate design purposes may differ in a Section 4 rate filing.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
