          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;">Kinder Morgan, Inc. directly owns 38.06% of Kinder Morgan Energy Partners, L.P. and 100% of Kinder Morgan GP LLC and KM Energy Inc.</xhtml:span>
